1
00:00:06,092 --> 00:00:08,436
Whiskers and the Dancing Lights.

2
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:23,512
One chilly morning, a fish van stopped right outside the cats' window.

3
00:00:23,712 --> 00:00:26,965
Whiskers, look! Those crates came all the way from Norway!

4
00:00:27,165 --> 00:00:31,504
Up there, the night sky dances, green and purple. I wish I could see it.

5
00:00:31,704 --> 00:00:35,382
Dancing skies are nice. Dancing fish are nicer.

6
00:00:35,582 --> 00:00:38,706
Now, Whiskers was very bad at waiting.

7
00:00:45,506 --> 00:00:48,359
Whiskers, wait! That crate is going to the airport!

8
00:00:53,128 --> 00:00:55,352
Hey! Come back! Oh, bring me a souvenir!

9
00:01:01,136 --> 00:01:06,433
So two cats flew north, in a crate of fish, inside a big cargo plane.

10
00:01:14,756 --> 00:01:17,862
Breakfast, lunch and dinner, all in one box!

11
00:01:18,062 --> 00:01:22,239
Whiskers, look! Mountains, and snow, and the sea, all tangled together!

12
00:01:29,546 --> 00:01:34,261
They landed in Bergen, a harbour town of little wooden houses.

13
00:01:39,030 --> 00:01:42,443
Hallo, stowaways! I'm Tuva the puffin. Welcome to Norway!

14
00:01:42,643 --> 00:01:44,752
Tuva, where can we see the northern lights?

15
00:01:44,952 --> 00:01:48,783
Far up the fjord, on Troll Hill. But first, you must try our waffles!

16
00:01:54,568 --> 00:01:57,004
Waffles? I'll have ten. Right now!

17
00:01:57,204 --> 00:01:59,158
Wait, wait! They're still too hot!

18
00:02:05,450 --> 00:02:08,555
Hot! Hot! I did that on purpose. To test them.

19
00:02:08,755 --> 00:02:11,857
Here. With brown cheese on top. Norwegian magic.

20
00:02:16,118 --> 00:02:20,229
It's cheese, but it tastes like caramel! I love this country!

21
00:02:24,490 --> 00:02:30,093
So Tuva took them up the fjord, in a real Viking longship with a dragon head.

22
00:02:39,939 --> 00:02:42,773
Look at the cliffs! They go all the way up to the clouds!

23
00:02:42,973 --> 00:02:46,817
And here are the Seven Sisters. The prettiest waterfalls in Norway!

24
00:02:54,125 --> 00:02:55,920
Nobody. Say. Anything.

25
00:03:05,765 --> 00:03:10,077
At the end of the fjord, the snowy forest grew dark and quiet.

26
00:03:16,369 --> 00:03:19,638
T-T-Troll! A real troll! Everybody run!

27
00:03:25,422 --> 00:03:29,349
A troll? Ho ho. No, little one. I am only Magnus, the moose.

28
00:03:29,549 --> 00:03:32,021
Magnus, will the northern lights dance tonight?

29
00:03:32,221 --> 00:03:37,154
Maybe. The lights come to those who wait. Climb on, I'll carry you up Troll Hill.

30
00:03:50,046 --> 00:03:55,866
On top of Troll Hill, they waited, and waited. But the sky stayed full of clouds.

31
00:03:56,066 --> 00:03:59,004
It's no use. We came all this way, and there's nothing.

32
00:03:59,204 --> 00:04:03,237
Hey. Remember the waffles? The best things need a little waiting.

33
00:04:03,437 --> 00:04:06,866
I'm not going anywhere, Luna. We'll wait together.

34
00:04:15,697 --> 00:04:18,203
Look up, little ones. The wind is changing.

35
00:04:35,157 --> 00:04:37,102
Whiskers... the sky is dancing!

36
00:04:37,302 --> 00:04:39,402
Green and purple! The northern lights!

37
00:04:46,709 --> 00:04:49,509
Luna? This was worth every single minute.

38
00:04:49,709 --> 00:04:51,210
Thank you for waiting with me.

39
00:05:11,717 --> 00:05:16,116
A few days later, the fish van brought two happy cats back home.

40
00:05:16,316 --> 00:05:18,271
You're back! Did you see the sky dance?

41
00:05:18,471 --> 00:05:21,815
We did, Pip. Because Whiskers waited with me, all night long.

42
00:05:22,015 --> 00:05:24,683
Whiskers? Waiting? For something that isn't food?

43
00:05:28,945 --> 00:05:32,436
This one's too hot. So I'll wait. One... two... three...

44
00:05:32,636 --> 00:05:33,589
Perfect!

45
00:05:39,881 --> 00:05:44,646
Because the most wonderful things are worth the wait, when you wait with a friend.

